WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:02.270
Petrol Pump and Vehicle Service.

2
00:00:02.550 --> 00:00:06.774
Day 58 of the Soft Skill Playbook course, in the Everyday Life phase.

3
00:00:08.524 --> 00:00:09.548
The key idea.

4
00:00:09.828 --> 00:00:17.977
Today's goal: fill fuel and air, book a service, describe a problem with your car or bike, approve repairs, and get help in a breakdown.

5
00:00:19.327 --> 00:00:20.181
Part 1.

6
00:00:20.461 --> 00:00:21.421
Key words.

7
00:00:22.671 --> 00:00:24.036
Here is a quick table:

8
00:00:24.316 --> 00:00:46.097
Word or phrase, and Meaning. petrol or diesel or CNG or EV charging: fuel types. fill it up or full tank: fill completely. tyre pressure or puncture or flat tyre: tyre issues. service or general service or oil change: routine maintenance. brakes or clutch or battery or engine or AC: car parts.

9
00:00:46.377 --> 00:00:59.028
noise or vibration or warning light: symptoms. estimate or job card or pickup and drop: service terms. breakdown or tow truck or roadside assistance: when the vehicle stops.

10
00:01:00.378 --> 00:01:01.253
Part 2.

11
00:01:01.533 --> 00:01:02.727
At the petrol pump.

12
00:01:03.977 --> 00:01:08.927
1,000 rupeespetrol, please. / Fill it up, please. / Full tank.

13
00:01:09.207 --> 00:01:10.807
Could you check the tyre pressure?

14
00:01:11.087 --> 00:01:13.775
32 in the front and 34 at the back.

15
00:01:14.055 --> 00:01:16.977
Please show me the zero on the meter before you start.

16
00:01:17.257 --> 00:01:19.391
Can I pay by card or UPI?

17
00:01:19.671 --> 00:01:21.463
Where can I get the puncture fixed?

18
00:01:22.813 --> 00:01:23.709
Part 3.

19
00:01:23.989 --> 00:01:25.375
Describing a problem.

20
00:01:26.625 --> 00:01:28.481
There's a squeaking noise when I brake.

21
00:01:28.761 --> 00:01:30.191
It started last week.

22
00:01:30.471 --> 00:01:32.839
The engine warning light came on this morning.

23
00:01:33.119 --> 00:01:35.380
The car pulls to the left when I drive straight.

24
00:01:35.660 --> 00:01:38.988
The AC isn't cooling properly, especially in traffic.

25
00:01:39.268 --> 00:01:42.724
The bike doesn't start in the morning; it takes four or five kicks.

26
00:01:44.074 --> 00:01:44.991
Part 4.

27
00:01:45.271 --> 00:01:47.767
Conversation 1: booking a car service.

28
00:01:49.017 --> 00:01:51.044
Here is how the conversation goes.

29
00:01:51.324 --> 00:01:53.585
Good morning, AutoCare service centre.

30
00:01:53.865 --> 00:01:54.591
Hi.

31
00:01:54.871 --> 00:01:58.305
I'd like to book a general service for my Honda City.

32
00:01:58.585 --> 00:02:00.889
It's due at 30,000 kilometres.

33
00:02:01.169 --> 00:02:01.873
Sure.

34
00:02:02.153 --> 00:02:03.775
Any specific problems?

35
00:02:04.055 --> 00:02:08.940
Yes, there's a squeaking noise when I brake, and the AC is weaker than before.

36
00:02:10.290 --> 00:02:11.890
The conversation continues.

37
00:02:12.170 --> 00:02:13.194
Noted.

38
00:02:13.474 --> 00:02:15.842
We'll check the brake pads and the AC gas.

39
00:02:16.122 --> 00:02:17.871
Is tomorrow at 10 okay?

40
00:02:18.151 --> 00:02:18.855
Yes.

41
00:02:19.135 --> 00:02:20.991
Do you offer pickup and drop?

42
00:02:21.271 --> 00:02:23.255
Yes, it's free for general service.

43
00:02:23.535 --> 00:02:24.282
Great.

44
00:02:24.562 --> 00:02:27.250
Could you call me before doing any extra work?

45
00:02:27.530 --> 00:02:29.962
I'd like to approve the estimate first.

46
00:02:31.312 --> 00:02:32.912
The conversation continues.

47
00:02:33.192 --> 00:02:34.109
Of course.

48
00:02:34.389 --> 00:02:36.309
We'll send the estimate on WhatsApp.

49
00:02:36.589 --> 00:02:37.528
Thank you.

50
00:02:38.878 --> 00:02:39.838
Part 5.

51
00:02:40.118 --> 00:02:42.507
Conversation 2: approving repairs.

52
00:02:43.757 --> 00:02:45.784
Here is how the conversation goes.

53
00:02:46.064 --> 00:02:47.515
Sir, we've checked the car.

54
00:02:47.795 --> 00:02:50.568
The front brake pads are worn out and need replacing.

55
00:02:50.848 --> 00:02:52.555
How much will that cost?

56
00:02:52.835 --> 00:02:56.376
3,800 rupeesfor the pads, including labour.

57
00:02:56.656 --> 00:03:00.560
And the AC needs a gas top-up, 1,500 rupees.

58
00:03:00.840 --> 00:03:02.803
Is the brake replacement urgent?

59
00:03:04.153 --> 00:03:05.753
The conversation continues.

60
00:03:06.033 --> 00:03:07.718
Yes, they're at 10%.

61
00:03:07.998 --> 00:03:09.385
It's a safety issue.

62
00:03:09.665 --> 00:03:11.798
Okay, please go ahead with both.

63
00:03:12.078 --> 00:03:14.382
Is there a warranty on the brake pads?

64
00:03:14.662 --> 00:03:17.009
Six months or 10,000 kilometres.

65
00:03:17.289 --> 00:03:18.099
Fine.

66
00:03:18.379 --> 00:03:20.235
When will the car be ready?

67
00:03:20.515 --> 00:03:22.115
By 5 pm today.

68
00:03:23.465 --> 00:03:25.065
The conversation continues.

69
00:03:25.345 --> 00:03:28.247
Please send me the final bill before delivery.

70
00:03:28.527 --> 00:03:29.337
Thanks.

71
00:03:30.687 --> 00:03:31.626
Part 6.

72
00:03:31.906 --> 00:03:33.229
Breakdown on the road.

73
00:03:34.479 --> 00:03:35.417
You could say:

74
00:03:35.697 --> 00:03:37.681
Hi, I need roadside assistance.

75
00:03:37.961 --> 00:03:44.212
My car has broken down on the NICE Road, near the Mysuru Road exit, heading towards Electronic City.

76
00:03:44.492 --> 00:03:46.284
The engine stopped and won't start.

77
00:03:46.564 --> 00:03:51.385
It's a white Honda City, KA-01-AB-1234.

78
00:03:51.665 --> 00:03:55.847
My policy number is RSA-55120.

79
00:03:57.197 --> 00:03:58.135
Part 7.

80
00:03:58.415 --> 00:03:59.461
Speak today.

81
00:04:00.711 --> 00:04:04.807
Say your vehicle's make, model, colour and number plate clearly in English.

82
00:04:05.087 --> 00:04:09.311
Practise describing one vehicle problem with what or when or since when.

83
00:04:10.661 --> 00:04:12.197
That's the end of this lesson.

84
00:04:12.477 --> 00:04:17.149
Pick one script from it, say it out loud three times, and use it for real today.

85
00:04:17.429 --> 00:04:23.530
For extra practice, paste the Master Prompt into an AI assistant and role-play the conversation.

